rview for the work itself; use the area directory to arrange the visit. If both trades may be involved, describe both symptoms in one request. The proposed work and qualified trade arrangements still need to be confirmed.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"plumbing.html\">Plumbing repairs and installation</a></li><li><a href=\"electrical.html\">Electrical repairs and installation</a></li><li><a href=\"property-management.html\">Repairs for managed properties</a></li></ul><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:0:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:0:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:1:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:1:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:2:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:2:answer}}</details></div><!-- site-intent:end --></section>" as TrustedHtml,
"items": [
{
"question": "Can I arrange plumbing and electrical work through one enquiry?",
"answer": "<p>Yes. Tell us which rooms, fittings or equipment are affected and identify any immediate danger. We confirm the appropriate trade arrangements and quote the agreed tasks; a combined enquiry does not mean every task can be completed in one visit.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Do I need to diagnose the fault before calling?",
"answer": "<p>No. Start with the Perth property location and what has changed. Photos are optional, and you should not enter a hazard or dismantle equipment to gather details.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "What are your routine hours and emergency arrangements?",
"answer": "<p>Routine service hours: 09:00–21:00, seven days a week. 24-hour emergency repairs are available; call to confirm attendance arrangements and the quoted emergency work. No arrival time is guaranteed. Emergency repair fees follow the quoted work plan. For urgent work, call rather than relying on an online enquiry.</p>" as TrustedHtml
}
]
},
{
"id": "section-7",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n    <p class=\"shell\">Photos are optional: email safely taken photos to <a href=\"mailto:maxinemaintenance.au@outlook.com\">maxinemaintenance.au@outlook.com</a>. You can contact us without photos. Do not approach a hazard or dismantle equipment to take them.</p>" as TrustedHtml
}
],
